  "match_cond": "group objects by their pixel-count (area). If an area value occurs >=2 times, those objects go to the TOP edge; if the area is unique, that object goes to the BOTTOM edge",
  "transform": "duplicated-size -> top; singleton-size -> bottom"
}
</annotation>
</reference_puzzle>

